      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, the vibe is definitely there. but honestly, looking at the engine logs, the \"depth score\" on that is way too low. it's flagging it as \"insubstantial\" for a main questline. \n\ncan you expand on this? try to go deeper into the lore of the Hollows and what Elara is actually guarding. and yeah, i'm saying this again—please don't just add useless adjectives or repeat yourself just to get the word count up. i need more actual narrative weight, not just more words. try to make it feel like a much more significant encounter.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
